{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T13:36:49.510043", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index for the primitive\n  index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n  \n  # If the primitive is already in inventory, return empty action list\n  if state.inventory[index] > 0:\n      return [], 0, []\n  \n  # Use BFS to find the shortest path to collect the primitive\n  queue = collections.deque([(state, [])])\n  visited = set()\n  visited.add(state.pos)\n  \n  while queue:\n      current_state, actions = queue.popleft()\n      \n      if current_state.inventory[index] > 0:\n          return actions, 0, actions\n      \n      # Get possible next states\n      for action in range(env.action_specs()['action'][1]):\n          new_state, reward = current_state.step(action)\n          \n          if new_state.pos not in visited:\n              visited.add(new_state.pos)\n              queue.append((new_state, actions + [action]))\n  \n  # If primitive cannot be collected, return empty list\n  return [], 0, []", "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": -1}}
