{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T13:52:16.921301", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index for the primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n\n  # Check if primitive is already in inventory\n  if state.inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return state, reward, action_list\n\n  # Find all locations where the primitive exists\n  primitive_locations = []\n  for i in range(state.grid.shape[0]):\n      for j in range(state.grid.shape[1]):\n          if state.grid[i, j, primitive_index] > 0:\n              primitive_locations.append((i, j))\n\n  # If no locations found, return failure\n  if not primitive_locations:\n      return state, reward, action_list\n\n  # Get the agent's current position\n  agent_pos = state.pos\n\n  # Simple pathfinding to nearest location\n  min_distance = float('inf')\n  target_pos = None\n  for loc in primitive_locations:\n      distance = abs(agent_pos[0] - loc[0]) + abs(agent_pos[1] - loc[1])\n      if distance < min_distance:\n          min_distance = distance\n          target_pos = loc\n\n  # Generate path to target location\n  path = []\n  current_pos = agent_pos\n  while current_pos != target_pos:\n      dx = target_pos[0] - current_pos[0]\n      dy = target_pos[1] - current_pos[1]\n\n      if dx > 0:\n          action = 1  # UP\n      elif dx < 0:\n          action = 0  # DOWN\n      elif dy > 0:\n          action = 3  # RIGHT\n      else:\n          action = 2  # LEFT\n\n      path.append(action)\n      current_pos = (current_pos[0] + [0, 1, 0, -1][action], current_pos[1] + [1, 0, -1, 0][action])\n\n  # Add pickup action at the final location\n  path.append(4)  # USE\n\n  # Execute actions and track reward\n  for a in path:\n      r, state = env.step(state, a)\n      reward += r\n\n  return state, reward, path", "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
