{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T14:07:19.088736", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # TODO: Implement this function according to the instructions.\n  # You may use the following functions from the CraftLab environment:\n  # - env._current_state: The current state of the environment\n  # - env.step(state, action): Execute an action and return (reward, new_state)\n  # - env.observations(): Return the observation dictionary for the current state\n\n  # You may also use any of the following functions from the CraftWorld module:\n  # - craft.CraftWorld: The CraftWorld class\n  # - craft.CraftScenario: The CraftScenario class\n  # - craft.CraftState: The CraftState class\n  # - craft.CraftLab: The CraftLab class\n\n  action_list = [] \n  reward = 0\n  state = env._current_state\n  for a in action_list:\n      r, state = env.step(state, a)\n      reward += r\n\n  return state, reward, action_list", "island_id": 0, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
