{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T14:08:28.268444", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # get the index of the primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n\n  # check if we already have it\n  if state.inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return [], 0, []\n\n  # if not, try to collect it\n  action_list = []\n  reward = 0\n\n  # get the position of the primitive\n  pos = None\n  for i in range(state.grid.shape[0]):\n      for j in range(state.grid.shape[1]):\n          if state.grid[i, j, primitive_index] > 0:\n              pos = (i, j)\n              break\n      if pos is not None:\n          break\n\n  # if we found it, collect it\n  if pos is not None:\n      # move to the position\n      while state.pos != pos:\n          action_list.append(env.action_specs()['RIGHT'])\n          r, state = env.step(state, action_list[-1])\n          reward += r\n\n      # pick it up\n      action_list.append(env.action_specs()['USE'])\n      r, state = env.step(state, action_list[-1])\n      reward += r\n\n  return state, reward, action_list", "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": -1}}
