{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T14:39:23.611294", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the primitive we want to collect\n  cookbook = env.world.cookbook\n  primitive_index = cookbook.index.get(primitive)\n\n  # If we already have the primitive, return empty action list\n  if state.inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return [], 0.0, []\n\n  # Find all positions that contain the primitive\n  positions = []\n  for x in range(state.grid.shape[0]):\n      for y in range(state.grid.shape[1]):\n          if state.grid[x, y, primitive_index] > 0:\n              positions.append((x, y))\n\n  # If no positions found, we can't collect it\n  if not positions:\n      return [], -1.0, []  # Return penalty reward\n\n  # Find the closest position to the agent's current position\n  closest_pos = min(positions, key=lambda p: abs(p[0] - state.pos[0]) + abs(p[1] - state.pos[1]))\n\n  # Generate path from agent's current position to the closest primitive position\n  path = []\n  current_pos = state.pos\n  while current_pos != closest_pos:\n      x, y = current_pos\n      nx, ny = closest_pos\n      if x < nx:\n          path.append(3)  # RIGHT\n          current_pos = (x + 1, y)\n      elif x > nx:\n          path.append(2)  # LEFT\n          current_pos = (x - 1, y)\n      elif y < ny:\n          path.append(1)  # DOWN\n          current_pos = (x, y + 1)\n      else:  # y > ny\n          path.append(0)  # UP\n          current_pos = (x, y - 1)\n\n  # Add the USE action at the end to collect the primitive\n  path.append(4)  # USE\n\n  return state, 0.0, path", "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
