{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T14:41:51.895011", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n\n  # Check if the primitive is already in inventory\n  if state.inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return state, reward, action_list\n\n  # Find the primitive in the environment\n  pos = None\n  for x in range(env.world.WIDTH):\n      for y in range(env.world.HEIGHT):\n          if env._current_state.grid[x][y][primitive_index] == 1:\n              pos = (x, y)\n              break\n      if pos is not None:\n          break\n\n  # If primitive is not found, return empty action list\n  if pos is None:\n      return state, reward, action_list\n\n  # Move to the primitive's position and collect it\n  while state.pos != pos:\n      action = get_action_to_move(state.pos, pos)\n      r, state = env.step(state, action)\n      reward += r\n      action_list.append(action)\n\n  # Collect the primitive\n  r, state = env.step(state, craft.USE)\n  reward += r\n  action_list.append(craft.USE)\n\n  return state, reward, action_list", "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
