{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T14:53:17.327258", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index of the primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n  \n  # Check if primitive is already in inventory\n  if state.inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return state, reward, action_list\n\n  # Find all cells that contain the primitive\n  primitive_cells = []\n  for i in range(state.grid.shape[0]):\n      for j in range(state.grid.shape[1]):\n          if np.any(state.grid[i,j] == primitive_index):\n              primitive_cells.append((i,j))\n\n  # If no primitive found, return empty action list\n  if not primitive_cells:\n      return state, reward, action_list\n\n  # Find the closest cell\n  min_dist = float('inf')\n  closest_cell = None\n  for cell in primitive_cells:\n      dist = abs(state.pos[0] - cell[0]) + abs(state.pos[1] - cell[1])\n      if dist < min_dist:\n          min_dist = dist\n          closest_cell = cell\n\n  # Use A* to find path to the closest primitive cell\n  path = a_star_pathfinding(state, closest_cell)\n\n  # Convert path to actions and append to action_list\n  for i in range(len(path)-1):\n      current_pos = path[i]\n      next_pos = path[i+1]\n      if next_pos[0] > current_pos[0]:\n          action_list.append(1) # UP\n      elif next_pos[0] < current_pos[0]:\n          action_list.append(0) # DOWN\n      elif next_pos[1] > current_pos[1]:\n          action_list.append(3) # RIGHT\n      elif next_pos[1] < current_pos[1]:\n          action_list.append(2) # LEFT\n\n  return state, reward, action_list", "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
