{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T14:58:05.152780", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # TODO: Implement this function\n  # You are allowed to use:\n  # - env._current_state (CraftState)\n  # - env.step(state, action) -> (float, CraftState)\n  # - state.next_to(i_kind) -> bool\n  # - state.features() -> numpy.ndarray\n  # - state.features_dict() -> dict\n  # - craft.WIDTH, craft.HEIGHT (grid dimensions)\n  # - craft.N_ACTIONS (number of actions)\n  # - craft.DOWN, craft.UP, craft.LEFT, craft.RIGHT, craft.USE (action indices)\n  # - env.world.cookbook.index.get(i) -> str (index to name mapping)\n  # - env.world.cookbook.primitives (set of primitive indices)\n  # - env.world.cookbook.environment (set of environment indices)\n  # - env.world.grabbable_indices (list of grabbable indices)\n  # - env.world.workshop_indices (list of workshop indices)\n  # - env.world.water_index, env.world.stone_index (special indices)\n\n  action_list = [] \n  reward = 0\n  state = env._current_state\n  for a in action_list:\n      r, state = env.step(state, a)\n      reward += r\n\n  return state, reward, action_list", "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
