{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T15:04:12.349063", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index for the primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n  \n  # Get current state and inventory\n  state = env._current_state\n  inventory = state.inventory\n  \n  # If we already have this primitive, return empty action list\n  if inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return [], 0, []\n  \n  # Find all positions where the primitive exists\n  positions = []\n  for y in range(state.grid.shape[1]):\n      for x in range(state.grid.shape[0]):\n          if state.grid[x, y, primitive_index] > 0:\n              positions.append((x, y))\n  \n  # If no positions found, return empty list\n  if not positions:\n      return [], 0, []\n  \n  # For now, just return an empty list (this needs to be implemented properly)\n  return [], 0, []", "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
