{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T15:26:21.749780", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # TODO: Implement this function\n  # Hint: You can use `env._current_state` to get the current state\n  # Hint: You can use `env.step(state, action)` to take an action\n  # Hint: You can use `state.pos` to get the agent's position\n  # Hint: You can use `state.grid` to get the grid\n  # Hint: You can use `state.inventory` to get the inventory\n  # Hint: You can use `env.world.cookbook.index.get(primitive)` to get the index of a primitive\n  # Hint: You can use `state.next_to(index)` to check if the agent is next to an item of that index\n\n  action_list = [] \n  reward = 0\n  state = env._current_state\n  for a in action_list:\n      r, state = env.step(state, a)\n      reward += r\n\n  return state, reward, action_list", "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
